<title>THAILAND: Bangkok Bank Q1 net rises.</title>
<headline>Bangkok Bank Q1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>First quarter to March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>			  (million baht unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)	   5.02	vs	   5.04</p>
<p>    Net		5,025.00	vs     4,520.00</p>
<p>NOTE: Latest results are unaudited but comparison figures for 1996 are based on consolidated results. Bangkok Bank Plc is Thailand's largest commercial bank.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom 662-652-0642</p>
</text>
